        <p>LOCAL NEWS.</p>
        <p>Every month, in each of the 8 dis- tricts, the 5 Competitors who send the largest number of Coupons from the dis- trict in which they reside, will each receive, at winner's option, a Lady's or Gent's " Premier " Safety Cycle, with Dunlop Pneumatic Tyres, value £2O. The next 20 Competitors will each receive, at winner's option, a Lady's or Gent's "Waltham" Stem-Winding Silver Lever Watch, value £4 45. The next 200 Competitors will each receive a Book, published at ss. The next 300 Competitors will each receive a Book, published at 35. 6d. The next 400 Competitors will each receive a Book, published at 2s. 6d. The next Soo Competitors will each receive a Book, published at 25. The next i,OOO Competitors will each receive a Book, published at is. RULES. I. The Competitions will Close the last day of each month. Coupons received too late for one month's com- petition will be put into the neat. Competitors who obtain wrappers from unsold soap in dealer's stock will be dirqualifted. Employees of Messrs. Lever Brothers, Limited, and their families, are debarred from competing. 111. A printed list of Winners of Bicycles and ',aches, and of Winning Numbers of Coupons for Books in Competitor's District will be forwarded, 21 days after each competition closes, to them competitors who send Half. enny Stamp for Postage, but in all cases where this to done, "Stamp extclo.ed " bhonld be written on the form. IV. Messrs. Lever Brothers Limited, will award the rites fairly to the best of their ability and judgment, hot it is understood that all who compete agree to accept the award of Messrs. Lever Brothers, Limited, a. neg.</p>
